{"4549180": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Taddius and the Forbidden Bog", "steam_appid": 4549180, "required_age": 0, "is_free": true, "dlc": [4821010], "detailed_description": "<h1>Demo Available Now!</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Taddius and the Forbidden Bog demo is finally available!  Try it now on Windows or Mac OS.  Please share feedback and take the survey when you have completed the demo.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >P.S. Controller support is in the works, and will be coming soon 🎮</p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4549180/extras/054ff37be02ed5385c6e458be91a73e0.webp?t=1781303083\" width=400 height=20 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><i>There are places that do not appear on any map. The Forbidden Bog is one such place — and it has been waiting for you.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4549180/extras/054ff37be02ed5385c6e458be91a73e0.webp?t=1781303083\" width=400 height=20 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4549180/extras/2f29b5ac66343408debde7e019b9d5eb.avif?t=1781303083\" width=1426 height=246 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You do not know your name. You do not know this place. And the stone figure watching you from the fog implores you to take on an important role.  One for those who do not turn back at the water's edge - the Bog requires a Keeper, and now that is you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Forbidden Bog was once refuge to many a weary traveler: offering up a warm bed, generous table, and a caretaker who keeps the darkness at bay. Now the bog is broken. Strange creatures from distant lands have torn it apart in their fear, the native folk have fled, and the travellers who stumble in are unaware of  the bog's cruelest secret:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Those who enter begin to forget. And those who forget too long are lost forever.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As Innkeeper, you must tend to your guests, restore the bog, and help  displaced creatures find their way home - before the forgetting takes hold. But somewhere beneath every duty and every mystery lies the question the bog will not let you ignore:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Who are you — and how do you find your own way home?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4549180/extras/054ff37be02ed5385c6e458be91a73e0.webp?t=1781303083\" width=400 height=20 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Taddius and the Forbidden Bog&quot; is a cozy inn-management mystery with a dark fairytale heart. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Tend. Restore. Remember.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Features</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the bog landscape</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Harvest and collect resources</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Host a variety of lost adventurers to the Forbidden Bog: each guest is randomly generated from a range of creature types, clothing, and accessories</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Help guests recover their memories with the memory tile mini-game</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect and learn about a range of displaced creatures</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build and customize your bog</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Set up services to enhance the inn experience for fellow lost souls</p></li></ul>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4549180/extras/054ff37be02ed5385c6e458be91a73e0.webp?t=1781303083\" width=400 height=20 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><i>There are places that do not appear on any map. The Forbidden Bog is one such place — and it has been waiting for you.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4549180/extras/054ff37be02ed5385c6e458be91a73e0.webp?t=1781303083\" width=400 height=20 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4549180/extras/2f29b5ac66343408debde7e019b9d5eb.avif?t=1781303083\" width=1426 height=246 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You do not know your name. You do not know this place. And the stone figure watching you from the fog implores you to take on an important role.  One for those who do not turn back at the water's edge - the Bog requires a Keeper, and now that is you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Forbidden Bog was once refuge to many a weary traveler: offering up a warm bed, generous table, and a caretaker who keeps the darkness at bay. Now the bog is broken. Strange creatures from distant lands have torn it apart in their fear, the native folk have fled, and the travellers who stumble in are unaware of  the bog's cruelest secret:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Those who enter begin to forget. And those who forget too long are lost forever.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As Innkeeper, you must tend to your guests, restore the bog, and help  displaced creatures find their way home - before the forgetting takes hold. But somewhere beneath every duty and every mystery lies the question the bog will not let you ignore:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Who are you — and how do you find your own way home?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4549180/extras/054ff37be02ed5385c6e458be91a73e0.webp?t=1781303083\" width=400 height=20 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Taddius and the Forbidden Bog&quot; is a cozy inn-management mystery with a dark fairytale heart. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Tend. Restore. Remember.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Features</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the bog landscape</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Harvest and collect resources</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Host a variety of lost adventurers to the Forbidden Bog: each guest is randomly generated from a range of creature types, clothing, and accessories</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Help guests recover their memories with the memory tile mini-game</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect and learn about a range of displaced creatures</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build and customize your bog</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Set up services to enhance the inn experience for fellow lost souls</p></li></ul>", "short_description": "In &quot;Taddius and the Forbidden Bog&quot;, manage an inn for lost travellers, restore a ravaged bog, and find purpose in the most unexpected of places.", "supported_languages": "English", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4549180/8012eb9225acd0a763ace560072c0eacbbc8acbc/header.jpg?t=1781303083", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4549180/28d5fbd378f6a785ad61c7a8e943bdbe9723ef1d/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1781303083", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4549180/28d5fbd378f6a785ad61c7a8e943bdbe9723ef1d/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1781303083", "website": "https://firstfieldtrip.com/", "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 64-bit<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i3-6100 or AMD equivalent<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 2 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GeForce GTX 750 Ti or AMD equivalent<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 220 MB available space<br></li><li><strong>Sound Card:</strong> DirectX compatible<br></li><li><strong>Additional Notes:</strong> Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 64-bit<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GTX 1050 / 1050 Ti<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 220 MB available space<br></li><li><strong>Sound Card:</strong> DirectX compatible<br></li><li><strong>Additional Notes:</strong> Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system</li></ul>"}, "mac_requi